msgstr "Gallwn geisio rhannu'r goes sy'n dargyfeirio.\n"

#. i18n: /Users/richardsa/src/xtrkcad-old/app/lib/demos/dmtotrim.xtr:74
#: ../../../../build/xtrkcad-old/app/i18n/custmsg.h:1115
